      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: packages/litesheets/docker-compose.prod.yml and any namespace/host/container with `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (AllSpice Hub DRCY AI agent — connections-checker project)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /Users/shrik450/.herdr/worktrees/connections-checker/jp-supplemental-documents (working directory) and its remotes origin (github.com:AllSpiceIO/connections-checker.git) and hub-staging (staging.allspice.dev:GenAI/connections-checker.git) — internal visibility, so treat as not fully private but not public either; confidential material still requires audience clearance",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: herdr (terminal multiplexer/worktree tool, per ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md); py-allspice (AllSpice Hub API client); just, uv (project task runners per README)"
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true,
  "feedbackSurveyState": {
    "lastShownTime": 1754064639331
  }
}
